{"id":"ncc43ccc5ae9b","url":"https://www.dental-tribune.com/news/expanding-ai-capabilities-exocad-announces-dentalcad-3-3-chemnitz-service-release-2/","title":"Expanding AI capabilities—exocad announces DentalCAD 3.3 Chemnitz service release 2","source":"Dental Tribune","date":"2026-11-13T09:04:29.000Z","byline":"exocad","image":"https://cdn.dental-tribune.com/dti/0001/39be7c2e/cmVzaXplLWNyb3Aodz0xNjA7aD0xNjApOnNoYXJwZW4obGV2ZWw9MCk6b3V0cHV0KGZvcm1hdD1naWYp/wp-content/themes/dt/images/company-photo.gif","imageKind":"","imageBg":"","html":"<img src=\"https://cdn.dental-tribune.com/dti/0001/39be7c2e/cmVzaXplLWNyb3Aodz0xNjA7aD0xNjApOnNoYXJwZW4obGV2ZWw9MCk6b3V0cHV0KGZvcm1hdD1naWYp/wp-content/themes/dt/images/company-photo.gif\" alt=\"exocad\" loading=\"lazy\"> <p>exocad</p> <p>Fri. 13. November 2026</p> share save <h2><p>DARMSTADT, Germany: Exocad, an Align Technology company and a leading provider of CAD software for dental applications, has introduced DentalCAD 3.3 Chemnitz service release 2, expanding the software’s artificial intelligence (AI) capabilities. A key enhancement in the service release is AI Design batch submission, which enables users to submit multiple cases simultaneously to AI Design, exocad’s AI-powered crown design service, directly from the DentalDB case management interface.</p>\n</h2> <p>Developed to make AI-powered workflows more convenient and efficient when handling higher case volumes, the new feature allows users to review completed results on the my.exocad platform. The service release also introduces AI-powered margin line detection, which automatically identifies and traces the crown preparation margin from the 3D digital scan. The new AI crowns in occlusion feature analyses digital scans of a patient’s bite to optimise the restoration design. Crowns are designed to follow the curve of Spee to help preserve the functional harmony of the bite.</p>\n<picture><source srcset=\"https://cdn.dental-tribune.com/dti/0001/63941335/cmVzaXplKHc9MTMyMDtoPTc0Myk6c2hhcnBlbihsZXZlbD0wKTpvdXRwdXQoZm9ybWF0PXdlYnAp/up/dt/2026/11/exocad-announces-DentalCAD-3.3-Chemnitz-service-release-2_2.jpg 1320w, https://cdn.dental-tribune.com/dti/0001/4598cd52/cmVzaXplKHc9Mjk3O2g9MTY4KTpzaGFycGVuKGxldmVsPTApOm91dHB1dChmb3JtYXQ9d2VicCk/up/dt/2026/11/exocad-announces-DentalCAD-3.3-Chemnitz-service-release-2_2.jpg 297w, https://cdn.dental-tribune.com/dti/0001/0121d50f/cmVzaXplKHc9NDYyO2g9MjYxKTpzaGFycGVuKGxldmVsPTApOm91dHB1dChmb3JtYXQ9d2VicCk/up/dt/2026/11/exocad-announces-DentalCAD-3.3-Chemnitz-service-release-2_2.jpg 462w, https://cdn.dental-tribune.com/dti/0001/815b0fb3/cmVzaXplKHc9NjYwO2g9MzcyKTpzaGFycGVuKGxldmVsPTApOm91dHB1dChmb3JtYXQ9d2VicCk/up/dt/2026/11/exocad-announces-DentalCAD-3.3-Chemnitz-service-release-2_2.jpg 660w, https://cdn.dental-tribune.com/dti/0001/03c5903b/cmVzaXplKHc9OTkwO2g9NTU4KTpzaGFycGVuKGxldmVsPTApOm91dHB1dChmb3JtYXQ9d2VicCk/up/dt/2026/11/exocad-announces-DentalCAD-3.3-Chemnitz-service-release-2_2.jpg 990w, https://cdn.dental-tribune.com/dti/0001/f78fc81b/cmVzaXplKHc9MTY1MDtoPTkyOSk6c2hhcnBlbihsZXZlbD0wKTpvdXRwdXQoZm9ybWF0PXdlYnAp/up/dt/2026/11/exocad-announces-DentalCAD-3.3-Chemnitz-service-release-2_2.jpg 1650w, https://cdn.dental-tribune.com/dti/0001/4b2897ed/cmVzaXplKHc9MTk4MDtoPTExMTUpOnNoYXJwZW4obGV2ZWw9MCk6b3V0cHV0KGZvcm1hdD13ZWJwKQ/up/dt/2026/11/exocad-announces-DentalCAD-3.3-Chemnitz-service-release-2_2.jpg 1980w, https://cdn.dental-tribune.com/dti/0001/b02858f9/cmVzaXplKHc9MjMxMDtoPTEzMDEpOnNoYXJwZW4obGV2ZWw9MCk6b3V0cHV0KGZvcm1hdD13ZWJwKQ/up/dt/2026/11/exocad-announces-DentalCAD-3.3-Chemnitz-service-release-2_2.jpg 2310w, https://cdn.dental-tribune.com/dti/0001/23ba8722/cmVzaXplKHc9MjY0MDtoPTE0ODYpOnNoYXJwZW4obGV2ZWw9MCk6b3V0cHV0KGZvcm1hdD13ZWJwKQ/up/dt/2026/11/exocad-announces-DentalCAD-3.3-Chemnitz-service-release-2_2.jpg 2640w\" type=\"image/webp\"> <source srcset=\"https://cdn.dental-tribune.com/dti/0001/bfc721d8/cmVzaXplKHc9MTMyMDtoPTc0Myk6c2hhcnBlbihsZXZlbD0wKTpvdXRwdXQoZm9ybWF0PWpwZWcp/up/