2.jpg\" alt=\"DentalCAD 3.3 Chemnitz service release 2 offers AI Design batch submission, which allows users to submit multiple cases for AI Design simultaneously.\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\t</picture><p>DentalCAD 3.3 Chemnitz service release 2 offers AI Design batch submission, which allows users to submit multiple cases for AI Design simultaneously.</p><picture><source srcset=\"https://cdn.dental-tribune.com/dti/0001/d013584e/cmVzaXplKHc9MTMyMDtoPTc0Myk6c2hhcnBlbihsZXZlbD0wKTpvdXRwdXQoZm9ybWF0PXdlYnAp/up/dt/2026/11/exocad-announces-DentalCAD-3.3-Chemnitz-service-release-2_3.jpg 1320w, https://cdn.dental-tribune.com/dti/0001/70b091cb/cmVzaXplKHc9Mjk3O2g9MTY4KTpzaGFycGVuKGxldmVsPTApOm91dHB1dChmb3JtYXQ9d2VicCk/up/dt/2026/11/exocad-announces-DentalCAD-3.3-Chemnitz-service-release-2_3.jpg 297w, https://cdn.dental-tribune.com/dti/0001/a3f0665f/cmVzaXplKHc9NDYyO2g9MjYxKTpzaGFycGVuKGxldmVsPTApOm91dHB1dChmb3JtYXQ9d2VicCk/up/dt/2026/11/exocad-announces-DentalCAD-3.3-Chemnitz-service-release-2_3.jpg 462w, https://cdn.dental-tribune.com/dti/0001/8b90244c/cmVzaXplKHc9NjYwO2g9MzcyKTpzaGFycGVuKGxldmVsPTApOm91dHB1dChmb3JtYXQ9d2VicCk/up/dt/2026/11/exocad-announces-DentalCAD-3.3-Chemnitz-service-release-2_3.jpg 660w, https://cdn.dental-tribune.com/dti/0001/50848725/cmVzaXplKHc9OTkwO2g9NTU4KTpzaGFycGVuKGxldmVsPTApOm91dHB1dChmb3JtYXQ9d2VicCk/up/dt/2026/11/exocad-announces-DentalCAD-3.3-Chemnitz-service-release-2_3.jpg 990w, https://cdn.dental-tribune.com/dti/0001/4a37c770/cmVzaXplKHc9MTY1MDtoPTkyOSk6c2hhcnBlbihsZXZlbD0wKTpvdXRwdXQoZm9ybWF0PXdlYnAp/up/dt/2026/11/exocad-announces-DentalCAD-3.3-Chemnitz-service-release-2_3.jpg 1650w, https://cdn.dental-tribune.com/dti/0001/c79773c7/cmVzaXplKHc9MTk4MDtoPTExMTUpOnNoYXJwZW4obGV2ZWw9MCk6b3V0cHV0KGZvcm1hdD13ZWJwKQ/up/dt/2026/11/exocad-announces-DentalCAD-3.3-Chemnitz-service-release-2_3.jpg 1980w, https://cdn.dental-tribune.com/dti/0001/edde2b56/cmVzaXplKHc9MjMxMDtoPTEzMDEpOnNoYXJwZW4obGV2ZWw9MCk6b3V0cHV0KGZvcm1hdD13ZWJwKQ/up/dt/2026/11/exocad-a